    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some thing Evol is afoot...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVOL is a retro-inspired pixel art platforming adventure game packed with precision jumps, chaotic battles, and strange friendships.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665610/extras/966aef3cfff700507596a09690d26bde.avif?t=1746548774\" width=650 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate handcrafted levels full of tight platforming challenges, battle corrupted goop in intense spawn-and-lock fights, and befriend a cast of quirky animal characters as you uncover the mystery behind a creeping corruption threatening to consume the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665610/extras/e38d53c35239c9446892f4773d9bdfba.avif?t=1746548774\" width=650 height=250 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls, Walk, Run, Jump, Dash, &amp; use your Sword to save your world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate tight platforming with precision jumps and dash &amp; wall jumps, the danger is always present.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be Spawned and Locked in, with tight battles that you will need to fight your way out of.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The different animal villages are all having issues with this null goo. You have made it your mission to void this null.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every animal has an Idol. Can you find them all? </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665610/extras/ad36f02bddf66bf0ff1ec688eda2e266.avif?t=1746548774\" width=650 height=250 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some thing Evol is afoot...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVOL is a retro-inspired pixel art platforming adventure game packed with precision jumps, chaotic battles, and strange friendships.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665610/extras/966aef3cfff700507596a09690d26bde.avif?t=1746548774\" width=650 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate handcrafted levels full of tight platforming challenges, battle corrupted goop in intense spawn-and-lock fights, and befriend a cast of quirky animal characters as you uncover the mystery behind a creeping corruption threatening to consume the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665610/extras/e38d53c35239c9446892f4773d9bdfba.avif?t=1746548774\" width=650 height=250 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls, Walk, Run, Jump, Dash, &amp; use your Sword to save your world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate tight platforming with precision jumps and dash &amp; wall jumps, the danger is always present.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be Spawned and Locked in, with tight battles that you will need to fight your way out of.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The different animal villages are all having issues with this null goo. You have made it your mission to void this null.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every animal has an Idol. Can you find them all? </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665610/extras/ad36f02bddf66bf0ff1ec688eda2e266.avif?t=1746548774\" width=650 height=250 /></span></p>",
